The wobble in src/tape.cc (the wow and flutter delay and its slow drift) follows Mutable Instruments Beads'
WowAndFlutter (https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack), rewritten in fixed point in coldsoldr/te-op1-cfw
(ports/fx/src/tape). The rest of this folder is coldsoldr's own (GPL-3.0-or-later with the OP-1 firmware permission,
see ../../LICENSE and ../../NOTICE); the plugin file built from it is conveyed under the GPL, which the MIT terms
allow. The halfband's coefficients follow hiir's design (Laurent de Soras, WTFPL).

